sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Cliente HIS
  participant API as Results API
  participant APP as Application
  participant CAT as Catalog API
  participant DB as Results DB
  UI->>API: POST /api/v1/lab-results
  API->>APP: CapturePendingResult(command)
  APP->>CAT: validar prueba/unidad (timeout)
  CAT-->>APP: metadata o error
  APP->>DB: guardar version y auditoria
  DB-->>APP: resultado persistido
  APP-->>API: resultado + correlation_id
  API-->>UI: 201 Created
